{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stalked At Home</i> is a <strong>single-player first-person horror game</strong>.<br>You play as a <strong>21-year-old woman</strong> who arrives at her boyfriend's house while he is away.<br>At first, everything feels normal \u2014 you can perform daily activities like cooking, driving, and interacting with objects around the house.<br>But as time passes, <strong>strange and frightening events</strong> begin to unfold.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully explorable house environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform daily activities (cooking, driving, interacting with objects)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradual build-up of psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic object interaction</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive and tense atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of normal life and sudden fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on storytelling and environmental details</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat \u2014 the horror comes from the feeling of being watched</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711650?t=1757525663","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711650?t=1757525663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711650/c93b09249c4eb0197541f5f20ab06be4391012d9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757525663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711650/c93b09249c4eb0197541f5f20ab06be4391012d9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757525663","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","